  "about": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "zh": "陈艺钊，建筑学专业在读，关注建筑空间、地域文化与日常生活之间的联系。创作与研究涉及建筑设计、空间观察与摄影等领域，尝试以不同媒介探索人与环境、空间与感知之间的关系。",
        "en": "Chen Yizhao is an architecture student whose work explores the connections between architectural space, regional culture, and everyday life. Working across architectural design, spatial observation, and photography, he uses different media to examine the relationships between people and their environment, and between space and perception."
      },
      {
        "zh": "通过镜头记录不同地域的自然景观、建筑形态与生活片段，将行走中的观察转化为对场所气质与日常细节的感知。在建筑与影像的交汇处，捕捉空间、时间与人的微妙联系，探索真实场景中那些易被忽略的诗意与温度。",
        "en": "Through photography, he records natural landscapes, architectural forms, and fragments of life across different regions, turning observations made while walking into a sense of place and an awareness of everyday details. At the intersection of architecture and imagery, he captures the subtle connections between space, time, and people, seeking the poetry and warmth that often go unnoticed in real places."
      }
    ],
    "portrait": "assets/about/portrait-large.jpg"
  },
