      "type": {
        "zh": "建筑设计",
        "en": "Architectural design"
      },
      "role": {
        "zh": "独立设计",
        "en": "Individual design"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "项目位于南京市玄武区进香河片区，以青年居住与街区公共生活的联系为切入点，探索兼顾独立生活与邻里交往的居住空间。设计通过架空、体量错动与多层平台组织建筑，拓展地面活动空间，并以楼梯和共享平台串联不同标高的日常路径。通透的公共界面引入自然光与街区视野，使交通空间兼具停留、交流和观察城市的可能。建筑以清晰的结构表达与公共、私密空间的层次变化，回应青年群体对居住自主性和社区归属感的需求，尝试在紧凑的城市环境中建立开放而有温度的生活场所。",
        "en": "Located in the Jinxianghe area of Nanjing’s Xuanwu District, the project explores connections between youth housing and neighborhood life, balancing independent living with opportunities for social interaction. Raised volumes, shifts in massing, and multilevel platforms extend ground-level activity spaces, while stairs and shared platforms link everyday routes at different heights. Transparent communal interfaces bring in daylight and views of the neighborhood, allowing circulation spaces to accommodate pauses, conversations, and observations of the city. Clear structural expression and graduated transitions between public and private spaces address young residents’ needs for autonomy and belonging, seeking an open and welcoming place to live within a compact urban setting."
      },
